00:09:35.087 --> 00:09:39.120
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:39.720 --> 00:09:48.600
<v Slow>「世界かんがい施設遺産」に認定された日本の施設は、いくつありますか。

00:09:49.399 --> 00:09:53.912
<v Host>Four — in Saitama, Shizuoka, Osaka, and Nara.

00:09:54.511 --> 00:10:00.799
<v Slow>葛西用水は、いつの時代に作られましたか。

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.912
<v Host>In the Edo period — the seventeenth century.

00:10:05.511 --> 00:10:12.015
