<v Host>The Tone River.

00:10:15.192 --> 00:10:21.720
<v Slow>認定式は、どこの国で行われる予定ですか。

00:10:22.519 --> 00:10:25.255
<v Host>In France — in the city of Marseille.

00:10:25.855 --> 00:10:38.528
<v Host>That's all for today. From an Edo-era canal to the moat of an ancient tomb, these waterways have fed Japan's fields for centuries — and now the world will remember them too. See you tomorrow.

00:10:39.128 --> 00:10:41.528
<v News>また明日。
